title: Onboarding tour — Step 3 · How we read them
direction: right

user: Customer [person]
acct: Accountant [person]
group clients: Clients [gray] {
  web: Web app [rounded]
  ios: Mobile apps
  email_in: E-mail inbox [document]
}
user -> web, ios, email_in
acct -> web
group ingest: Ingestion [blue] {
  upload: Upload svc
  s3: Object store [cylinder]
}
web, ios -> upload: photo / PDF
email_in -> upload: attachment
upload -> s3
group ml: Extraction [purple] {
  extract: OCR + extractor
  conf: Confident? [diamond]
}
review: Human review [orange, rounded]
s3 ..> extract -> conf
conf -> review: no
